000001 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000002 PROGRAM-ID. RISKSCR.
000003* Synthetic batch subprogram: credit risk grade from use of limit, missed payments and age.
000004 DATA DIVISION.
000005 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000006 01  WS-SCORE                PIC 9(3).
000007 01  WS-UTIL                 PIC 9(5).
000008 01  WS-I                    PIC 9(3).
000009 LINKAGE SECTION.
000010 01  LK-BALANCE              PIC S9(9)V99.
000011 01  LK-LIMIT                PIC S9(9)V99.
000012 01  LK-MISSED               PIC 9(2).
000013 01  LK-YEARS                PIC 9(2).
000014 01  LK-SCORE                PIC 9(3).
000015 01  LK-GRADE                PIC X.
000016 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-BALANCE LK-LIMIT LK-MISSED LK-YEARS
000017                          LK-SCORE LK-GRADE.
000018 MAIN-PARA.
000019     MOVE 0 TO WS-SCORE
000020     IF LK-LIMIT > 0
000021         COMPUTE WS-UTIL = LK-BALANCE * 100 / LK-LIMIT
000022     ELSE
000023         MOVE 100 TO WS-UTIL
000024     END-IF
000025     IF WS-UTIL >= 90
000026         ADD 40 TO WS-SCORE
000027     ELSE
000028         IF WS-UTIL >= 50
000029             ADD 20 TO WS-SCORE
000030         END-IF
000031     END-IF
000032     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > LK-MISSED
000033         ADD 15 TO WS-SCORE
000034     END-PERFORM
000035     IF LK-YEARS < 2
000036         ADD 10 TO WS-SCORE
000037     END-IF
000038     EVALUATE TRUE
000039         WHEN WS-SCORE >= 70
000040             MOVE 'D' TO LK-GRADE
000041         WHEN WS-SCORE >= 40
000042             MOVE 'C' TO LK-GRADE
000043         WHEN WS-SCORE >= 20
000044             MOVE 'B' TO LK-GRADE
000045         WHEN OTHER
000046             MOVE 'A' TO LK-GRADE
000047     END-EVALUATE
000048     MOVE WS-SCORE TO LK-SCORE
000049     GOBACK.
